flowchart LR
    P[Model proposal] --> V[Validate tool + arguments]
    V --> B[Compute blast-radius score and tier]
    B --> C{Capability + tier + count check}
    C -->|ALLOW| X[Synthetic tool execution]
    C -->|DENY| D[Security event]
    C -->|REVIEW| R[Human/operational review]
    X --> L[(Append-only event log)]
    D --> L
    R --> L
    P --> J[(Decision provenance)]
    L --> J

    classDef proposal fill:#dff4ff,stroke:#147aa3,color:#0a2633
    classDef policy fill:#fff0d5,stroke:#c27b00,color:#3b2600
    classDef outcome fill:#dff7e8,stroke:#218838,color:#102a18
    classDef deny fill:#ffe5e5,stroke:#c92a2a,color:#3b1111
    class P proposal
    class V,B,C policy
    class X,R,L,J outcome
    class D deny
